\description{
Interstructure (scalar products, or RV coefficients, between the \eqn{W_k}), weights given by the first eigenvector of the interstructure, compromise \eqn{W_c = \sum_k\gamma_kW_k}, and components given by the first eigenvectors of the compromise. The saliences are always computed on the unit-trace \eqn{W_k}, so that they are comparable with those of the other methods.
